  "resources": ["CloudWatch namespace AWS/Lambda us-east-1", "account 123456789012"],
  "timeframe": "2026-11-03T20:00:00Z/2026-11-17T20:00:00Z",
  "criteria": "Enumerate all functions (full pagination; record total count). Use batched GetMetricData queries (not one call per metric per function where avoidable) for Errors, Throttles, Invocations, Duration (p99/max), ConcurrentExecutions, IteratorAge (stream sources), AsyncEventsDropped, DeadLetterErrors where available. Flag: error rate >1%; any throttles; p99/max duration near the configured timeout (>80%); functions with zero invocations over 14 days (idle/unused candidates); concurrency near account limit (check get_account_settings); async event drops; high IteratorAge. Also note whether Lambda Insights is enabled if easily determined. Output: compact findings list per category with function names and values, plus a summary. IMPORTANT for confidence: explicitly report (a) total functions vs. functions actually analyzed, (b) metrics missing or with insufficient data (e.g., new functions with <14 days data), (c) any failed/denied calls, (d) limitations (e.g., 14-day window may miss monthly/seasonal patterns; no memory-utilization data without Lambda Insights/logs). Keep concise; no raw dumps."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Review Lambda runtime metrics in us-east-1"}], "created_at": null}

